### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Get Doctors
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors

###

### Add Doctor
POST http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "doctorName":"Dr Rahul",
    "specialization":"Cardiologist",
    "email":"rahul@gmail.com"
}

###

